                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Some nice sounds and they create some cool loops.\n\nOverall this seems like it has a lot of potential but I've been running into a variety of issues I hope will be resolved in future updates I will list all of them here.\n\n1) I can't seem to control where the different effects get inserted into the sound loops the program chooses for me\n2) I can't choose which sound to create, I have to just create a bunch until the one I want appears\n3) I can't make separate loops everything goes into a single loop, this makes it hard to properly create a custom soundscape / music  etc\n4) I can't tune the speed at which the loop goes through the nodes\n\nIf anyone knows how to do these things I'd really like to know, or if the devs intend to add this functionality at a later date.\n\nIn conclusion, fun toy, with great potential, but currently not a lot of depth. But hey it's free and for that price it's pretty cool already.",
